OcPlayer for Windows\par\par
This installer includes the .NET and Windows App SDK runtimes. No separate runtime installation is required.\par\par
Settings, credentials, playback history and caches are stored separately from the application. Upgrades retain this data. Uninstalling removes the application and its registered shortcuts and protocol handler, and retains your personal data.\par\par
Third-party component licenses and notices are included with the application and are available in Settings.\par
